<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθρῴσκω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θοροῦμαι,</span>
		
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θορέομαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έθορον,</span>
		
			Ep.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρθορον</span>; inf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θορεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.134
				</span></i>
			, 
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-θορέειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					12.53
				</span></i>
			 (v. l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c.): —<i>overleap, leap</i> or <i>spring
				over,</i> c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάφρον ὑπερθορέονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.179
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέρθορον ἑρκίον αὐλῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.476
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				12.53
			</span></i>; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθ. τοὺς ἀνθρώπους, τὸ
				ἕρκος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.66
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.134
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδίον Ἀσωποῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					297
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				827
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾶριν οὐχ ὑπερθορεῖ</span>
			<i>will</i> not <i>escape from</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				873
			</span></i> (lyr.): also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὲρ ἕρκος ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sol.
					4.29
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεως ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					823
				</span></i>
			.</div>
